181
00:10:38,501 --> 00:10:40,800
Another standout in their growing product line

182
00:10:40,801 --> 00:10:42,240
is the Roadrunner.

183
00:10:42,241 --> 00:10:45,200
We decided that people wanted a little more entertainment,

184
00:10:45,201 --> 00:10:47,740
maybe a little more bang out of their quarter.

185
00:10:47,741 --> 00:10:49,480
We made a spiral machine.

186
00:10:49,481 --> 00:10:52,060
so that after you put your quarter in and you turn the handle,

187
00:10:53,060 --> 00:10:54,460
you get a little bit of a show,

188
