00:11:05,260 --> 00:11:06,760
Here at OK Manufacturing,

192
00:11:06,761 --> 00:11:09,020
we make almost all of our own plastic parts.

193
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:11,160
For instance, we start with plastic sheets

194
00:11:11,161 --> 00:11:15,040
that we put into our plastic vacuum thermal former

195
00:11:15,041 --> 00:11:17,360
where it's heated up and sucked over a mold,

196
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,580
which we also make here.

197
00:11:19,480 --> 00:11:24,480
We make a lot of our own circular globes here through a custom process.

198
