We take sheets of clear plastic, place it in an oven where it's heated up,

199
00:11:29,481 --> 00:11:34,480
where it becomes nice and pliable, and it's placed in our custom machine,

200
00:11:34,481 --> 00:11:40,480
where we actually inject air that blows the globe up until it hits a microswitch.

201
00:11:40,481 --> 00:11:46,480
And that microswitch is set at a certain height depending on the diameter of the globe.

202
